 [[Bracketed]]
 ```
 
+To show different text than the page name, separate the target and the label
+with a pipe: ``[[Target|Label]]``. Whitespace around the pipe is ignored. The
+label uses the same allowed characters as the target.
+
+``` md-render
+---
+extensions: [wikilinks]
+---
+[[Bracketed|read the guide]]
+```
+
 Note that WikiLinks are automatically assigned `class="wikilink"` making it
 easy to style WikiLinks differently from other links on a page if one so
 desires. See below for ways to alter the class.
